OL,3,ASeveral injured after sword attack at
OL,4,ASwedish school
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been injured after
OL,7,Fa sword attack at a high school in
OL,8,FSweden, local authorities say.
OL,10,FPolice said they had arrested one man
OL,11,Fafter the incident at Brinell School in
OL,12,FFagersta, central Sweden.
OL,14,FOfficers were called to the scene just
OL,15,Fafter 14:00 local time (13:00 BST) on
OL,16,FFriday, with some reports in Swedish
OL,17,Fmedia saying the suspect was shot in
OL,18,Fthe leg by police.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
