OL,3,ASeveral injured after sword attack at
OL,4,ASwedish school
OL,5,
OL,6,FFagersta council did not specify the
OL,7,Fnumber of wounded, but said police were
OL,8,Fsearching the building and that eight
OL,9,Fother schools had been placed under
OL,10,Flockdown measures.
